    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Querías algo? Si es un combate Pokémon,\npor mí, estupendo.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 200,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00BF005100750065007200ED0061007300200061006C0067006F003F00200053006900200065007300200075006E00200063006F006D006200610074006500200050006F006B00E9006D006F006E002C000A0070006F00720020006D00ED002C0020006500730074007500700065006E0064006F002E00100002011401280000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 64
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Qué eres, de es<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿāoas brut<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿāoas que solo conocen\nel cuerpo a cuerpo?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 328,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 79
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Mi estilo es más bien atacar a distancia, la verdad.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 488,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D006900200065007300740069006C006F0020006500730020006D00E100730020006200690065006E002000610074006100630061007200200061002000640069007300740061006E006300690061002C0020006C00610020007600650072006400610064002E00100002011401280000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 57
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Basta con saber posicionar a tu Pokémon de\nmanera estratégica para que ataque desde lejos.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 604,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 95
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Aunque es verdad que los movimientos\na distancia tardan un tiempo en...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 796,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 76
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Bueno, que me enrollo como las persianas.\nYa vale de teoría, el resto lo verás en combate.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 948,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 95
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Cuando estés list<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿāoa para la práctica, ven a hablar\nconmigo.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1140,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004300750061006E0064006F002000650073007400E900730020006C00690073007400100003110000FF0101006F0061002000700061007200610020006C006100200070007200E100630074006900630061002C002000760065006E002000610020006800610062006C00610072000A0063006F006E006D00690067006F002E00100002011401280000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 69
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1280,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿List<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿāoa para que te dé un rapapolvo?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1292,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00BF004C00690073007400100003110000FF0101006F00610020007000610072006100200071007500650020007400650020006400E900200075006E002000720061007000610070006F006C0076006F003F00100002011401280000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 46
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡List<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿāoa... para dártelo a ti!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1384,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A1004C00690073007400100003110000FF0101006F0061002E002E002E002000700061007200610020006400E1007200740065006C006F0020006100200074006900210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Espera un momento",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1456,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00450073007000650072006100200075006E0020006D006F006D0065006E0074006F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Como si yo no tuviera nada que hacer!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1492,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10043006F006D006F00200073006900200079006F0020006E006F002000740075007600690065007200610020006E0061006400610020007100750065002000680061006300650072002100100002011401280000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Prepárate para un combate a distancia!\n¡Seré inalcanzable!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1580,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A1005000720065007000E100720061007400650020007000610072006100200075006E00200063006F006D006200610074006500200061002000640069007300740061006E0063006900610021000A00A100530065007200E900200069006E0061006C00630061006E007A00610062006C0065002100100002011401280000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 64
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1708,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Pues resulta que te defiendes bien!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1720,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A1005000750065007300200072006500730075006C007400610020007100750065002000740065002000640065006600690065006E0064006500730020006200690065006E002100100002011401280000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Los movimientos que llegan lejos tardan\nun tiempo en lanzarse.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1804,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004C006F00730020006D006F00760069006D00690065006E0074006F007300200071007500650020006C006C006500670061006E0020006C0065006A006F0073002000740061007200640061006E000A0075006E0020007400690065006D0070006F00200065006E0020006C0061006E007A0061007200730065002E00100002011401280000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 67
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Por su parte, los movimientos de corto alcance\nte obligan a gastar tiempo en acercarte al rival.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1940,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 101
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Por eso, si estás ya cerca del adversario, es más\nefectivo usar movimientos de corto alcance.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2144,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 98
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Pero yo sigo prefiriendo atacar de lejos,\nal fin y al cabo soy un estratega.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 2340,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 81
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Además, ¡para los pobres Pokémon tiene que ser\naterrador meterse en mitad del combate!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 2504,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 91
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 2688,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Los movimientos de largo alcance tardan más\ntiempo en lanzarse que los de corto alcance.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n¡Úsalos con cabeza y triunfarás!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĨ",
